    "body": "<main style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px\">\r\n  <a href=\"/blog\" style=\"color:#c4a35a;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px\">← Back to Blog</a>\r\n  <span style=\"color:#555;font-size:12px;margin-left:12px\">2026-08-22</span>\r\n  <h1 style=\"font-size:2rem;margin:16px 0 8px\">Pokemon Emerald Nuzlocke Challenge: Complete Guide</h1>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#aaa;margin-bottom:24px\">Rules, tips, and strategies for the ultimate Pokemon Emerald Nuzlocke run.</p>\r\n\r\n  <p style=\"color:#ccc;margin-bottom:16px\">The Nuzlocke challenge turns Pokemon from a casual adventure into a heart-pounding survival experience. Here's everything you need to know to complete a Pokemon Emerald Nuzlocke.</p>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;margin:24px 0 12px;color:#c4a35a\">Core Rules</h2>\r\n  <ol style=\"padding-left:20px;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:24px\">\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">First Encounter Only:</strong> You can only catch the first Pokemon you encounter in each area. If you fail to catch it, you get nothing.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">Perma-Death:</strong> If a Pokemon faints, it's considered dead. You must release it or box it permanently.</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">Nickname Everything:</strong> All Pokemon must be nicknamed. This builds emotional attachment (and makes their death hurt more).</li>\r\n  </ol>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;margin:24px 0 12px;color:#c4a35a\">Popular Optional Rules</h2>\r\n  <ul style=\"padding-left:20px;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:24px\">\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">Set Mode:</strong> You must use the same switching rules as the AI (set, not shift)</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">No Items in Battle:</strong> Cannot use healing items during trainer battles</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">Level Cap:</strong> Pokemon cannot exceed the next gym leader's highest Pokemon level</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">Dupes Clause:</strong> If you already have a Pokemon of that species, you can skip the encounter</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;margin:24px 0 12px;color:#c4a35a\">Tips for Success</h2>\r\n  <ul style=\"padding-left:20px;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:24px\">\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Grind levels before gym battles — being underleveled is the #1 killer</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Always have a backup plan. If your main Pokemon faints, who takes its place?</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Type matchups matter more than ever. Know your weaknesses</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Use the dupes clause to build a diverse team</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Save your Rare Candies for the endgame</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\n\r\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:1.3rem;margin:24px 0 12px;color:#c4a35a\">Why Nuzlocke Is Better in Browser</h2>\r\n  <p style=\"color:#ccc;margin-bottom:16px\">Playing a Nuzlocke on <a href=\"/pokemon-emerald\" style=\"color:#c4a35a\">EggerMath's browser emulator</a> has advantages:</p>\r\n  <ul style=\"padding-left:20px;color:#ccc;margin-bottom:24px\">\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">Save states:</strong> Save before risky encounters (if you allow it)</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">Fast forward:</strong> Grind levels faster</li>\r\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px\"><strong style=\"color:#c4a35a\">No battery issues:</strong> Original GBA cartridges lose saves when the battery dies</li>\r\n  </ul>\r\r\n\r\n  <div style=\"margin-top:32px;padding:20px;background:#111;border:1px solid #1e1e22;border-radius:12px\">\r\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;margin-bottom:8px\">Start Your Nuzlocke Now</h2>\r\n    <p style=\"color:#aaa;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px\">Pokemon Emerald is available free in your browser. Ready to risk it all?</p>\r\n    <a href=\"/pokemon-emerald\" style=\"color:#c4a35a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700\">Play Pokemon Emerald →</a>\r\n  </div>\r\n</main>",
